- **Selection:**  
  σ Age > 40 (Patients)  
  σ Gender = 'Female' (Patients)

- **Projection:**  
  π Name, Age (Patients)  
  π Title (Clinical_Trials)

- **Join:**  
  Patients ⟒ Results  
  Studies ⟒ Clinical_Trials

- **Union:**  
  π Name (Patients) ∪ π Name (Doctors)

- **Difference:**  
  π Patient_ID (Patients) - π Patient_ID (Results)

- **Cartesian Product:**  
  Patients × Drugs

- **Natural Join:**  
